WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.478
Puss came to a cornfield.

2
00:00:09.479 --> 00:00:13.118
"Hey there!" Puss called to some workers.

3
00:00:13.119 --> 00:00:17.213
One man looked up in surprise. "Yes?"

4
00:00:17.214 --> 00:00:20.130
"The king is coming," Puss said.

5
00:00:20.131 --> 00:00:26.793
"Tell him the Duke of Carabas owns this cornfield."

6
00:00:26.794 --> 00:00:38.839
"I won't lie to the king," the man said.

7
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:43.530
Puss hissed and showed his claws.

8
00:00:43.531 --> 00:00:45.145
"Do as I say.

9
00:00:45.146 --> 00:00:49.496
Or I'll eat you for dinner!"

10
00:00:49.497 --> 00:00:57.987
The man held up his hands. "Okay, okay!"

11
00:00:57.988 --> 00:01:03.597
The carriage rolled along.

12
00:01:03.598 --> 00:01:08.530
"That's a magnificent cornfield," the king said.

13
00:01:08.531 --> 00:01:11.291
"I wonder who owns it."

14
00:01:11.292 --> 00:01:14.295
Fiona didn't hear the king.

15
00:01:14.296 --> 00:01:19.492
She was playing her guitar.

16
00:01:19.493 --> 00:01:22.632
Carabas didn't hear him either.

17
00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:26.830
He was listening to the beautiful music.

18
00:01:26.831 --> 00:01:30.470
The king leaned out of the carriage.

19
00:01:30.471 --> 00:01:42.186
"Who owns this cornfield?" he called.

20
00:01:42.187 --> 00:01:45.817
The king smiled when he heard the answer.

21
00:01:45.818 --> 00:01:48.573
"Duke!" the king said.

22
00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:52.682
"I didn't know you owned a cornfield!"

23
00:01:52.683 --> 00:01:56.214
"Huh?" Carabas said.

24
00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:59.884
Puss danced as he walked along.

25
00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:05.965
"My plan is working perfectly!" he thought.

26
00:02:05.966 --> 00:02:09.894
Soon Puss saw a castle.

27
00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:13.181
It was a fine castle.

28
00:02:13.182 --> 00:02:17.208
A farmer was working nearby.

29
00:02:17.209 --> 00:02:21.408
"Who owns that castle?" Puss asked.

30
00:02:21.409 --> 00:02:25.594
"An ogre owns it," the farmer said.

31
00:02:25.595 --> 00:02:28.568
"Don't go near it!"

32
00:02:28.569 --> 00:02:38.824
Puss puffed out his chest. "I'm not afraid of ogres!"

